Re: murder--even chaotics get alignment hits for angering or killing 
peacefuls. They don't get the "You murderer!" message and penalties for 
killing their own race, but they can't just kill peacefuls with total 
immunity either. One of the most common types of unintentional 
self-conversion is a chaotic character killing all the minetown guards 
and then attempting to convert the minetown altar.

Re: sacrificing one's own species: that you *may* do it does not mean 
that you *must* do it. If doing so upsets roleplay for you, then don't 
do it.

